From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:22:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/61] movement-persona

The pointer's human-movement persona: a bit-exact port of the launcher's
persona generator (31 fields drawn from java.util.Random(seed), approach
hesitation, tremor harmonics) plus the hand's kinematics. Shared by the
Input domain's humanized actions and by Browser.getFingerprint.
